    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59186" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορῠδός</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lark</i>, esp. <i>crested lark, Alauda cristata</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				472
			</span></i>, al. (on the accent v. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.143
			</span></i>):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρῠδος</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				266
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				291b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				559a2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				614a33
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐν ἀμούσοις
			φθέγγεται</span>, 'au royaume des aveugles les borgnes sont
			rois', <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1072.40
			</span></i>.—Other forms are: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυδών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>, ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				609a7
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυδαλλή</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				45
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυδαλλίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, πάσαισιν κορυδαλλίσιν χρὴ λόφον
					ἐγγενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					68
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.23
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυδαλλός</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				10.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				72.20
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορύδαλος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				617b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				633b1
			</span></i>.</div>
